.DS_Store
/.kobo/
/target/
# Tests in a crate write their scratch under that crate's own target
# directory, which the root pattern never covered: the store smoke test's
# fixture device was committed this way, and every run since has rewritten
# bytes nobody reads.
/crates/kobod/target/
/crates/kobo-cli/target/
/.pass

# Credentials. `kobo secret` reads keys off this machine and writes them
# straight to the reader; nothing it touches belongs in a commit. These
# patterns are here so a key that is copied into the tree for a moment cannot
# be added by accident.
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
.openai
.anthropic
.credentials

# The running development log. Useful while building, not part of what ships.
BUILD_IN_PUBLIC.md
